                                                "sense_id": "b4dccaa4-0535-343e-ad73-852892b7fd73",
                                                "text": "THEOREM 37°. (Gödel's completeness theorem 1930.) In the predicate calculus H:\n(a) If #92;vDashF [or even if #92;aleph#95;0-#92;vDashF], then #92;vdashF. If E#95;1,...,E#95;k#92;vDashF [or even if E#95;1,...,E#95;k#92;#92;aleph#95;0-#92;vDashF], then E#95;1,...,E#95;k#92;vdashF.\n(b) […]"
                                            }
